        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basket Bots is a 1v1 physical based Basket Ball game. Control a bot, push the ball into the basket, score, win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for fun, bounce the ball everywhere, and enjoy your good (or bad) luck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with skill, aim the right angle to score a 3 points, roll to protect yourself, jump with the right timing to defend you basket and destroy you opponent !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the physic !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Dash or Roll to bounce the ball and score 2 or 3 points !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.poster.avif?t=1763629527\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.webm?t=1763629527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.mp4?t=1763629527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy your opponent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash toward your enemy to break it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.poster.avif?t=1763629527\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.webm?t=1763629527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.mp4?t=1763629527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect pickups to change the game </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch up to 8 different bonus. Get faster, bigger, or modify the arena. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play locally versus a friend or an AI</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a controller is recommended, but keyboard input is working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
